Modifications by Hyzer Labs, beginning 2026-08-06:

  - Replaced the OpenCode plugin (src/plugin.ts) with an MCP server
    (src/server.ts). Annotations are queued in memory and pulled by the agent
    through a `get_annotations` tool, rather than pushed into an OpenCode
    session via its plugin client.
  - Removed OpenCode session enumeration and title tracking. One server process
    now maps to exactly one agent session.
  - Changed the discovery app id to "hyzer-annotate" and the port range to
    39280-39300, so this extension and the upstream one do not find each
    other's servers.
  - Rewrote user-facing strings in extension-src/ to be agent-neutral.
  - Replaced bun with esbuild in the build scripts.
  - Added test/smoke.mjs.

The unmodified upstream source is preserved as the first commit in this
repository's history for comparison.
